request.description:
Server-Sent Events stream for real-time progress updates. Each event is a JSON object: `{ step, progress_pct, message }`.

**Note:** Postman does not render SSE streams interactively. Use `curl` or the Investigation Portal for live streaming:
```
curl -N -H 'X-API-Key: {{api_key}}' \
  {{base_url}}/api/v1/submissions/{{submission_id}}/stream
```

Expected event sequence:
```
data: {"step":"parsing","progress_pct":10,"message":"Parsing 3400 lines"}
data: {"step":"correlating","progress_pct":30,"message":"Grouping events"}
data: {"step":"classifying","progress_pct":50,"message":"Classifying 420 events"}
data: {"step":"analysing","progress_pct":75,"message":"Calling Nemotron Ultra 253B"}
data: {"step":"fix_suggestions","progress_pct":90,"message":"Querying Tavily"}
data: {"step":"complete","progress_pct":100,"message":"Analysis complete"}
```

